--- OLD
    DEC item_soft              ; remove soft from inventory
    JSR DrawItemTargetMenu
    JSR MenuWaitForBtn_SFX
    JMP EnterItemMenu
--- NEW
    LDX #item_soft - items     ; remove soft from inventory
    JSR OptUsedPotion
    PHP
    JSR DrawItemTargetMenu
    JSR MenuWaitForBtn_SFX
    PLP
    BCS @Loop                  ; Repeated Potion Use: stay on the target menu
    JMP EnterItemMenu
